2026-07-27T14:24:02.2715342Z i /tmp/Rtmpigaodv/duckdb
2026-07-27T14:24:02.2715611Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T14:24:02.2715914Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T14:24:02.2716176Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T14:24:02.2716577Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T14:24:02.2717154Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T14:24:02.2717770Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
